        <h2>What is Real Estate Mediation?</h2>
        <p>Real estate mediation is a confidential process where a neutral mediator helps parties resolve property-related disputes and reach mutually agreed solutions without going to court.</p>
        
        <p>Common searches include:</p>
        <ul class="search-list">
          <li>"Property dispute mediation near me in Texas"</li>
          <li>"Landlord tenant mediation online USA"</li>
          <li>"How to resolve real estate disputes without court"</li>
