        <li>Property line and boundary disputes</li>
        <li>Real estate transaction disagreements</li>
        <li>Construction defects or delays</li>
        <li>Title and ownership issues</li>
        <li>Realtor-client disputes</li>
        <li>Eminent domain concerns</li>
