      <h2>Top Reasons to Choose Mediation Over Litigation</h2>
      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Faster Resolution</strong>
          <span>Resolve quicker than court proceedings</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Lower Costs</strong>
          <span>Save on legal fees and court expenses</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Confidential</strong>
          <span>Keep disputes private</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <strong>Preserve Relationships</strong>
          <span>Maintain professional connections</span>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
