    <div class="service-section">
      <h2>Legally Binding Agreements (MSA Validity)</h2>
      <p>All successful mediations result in a Mediation Settlement Agreement (MSA):</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Legally binding and enforceable</li>
        <li>Clearly outlines responsibilities</li>
        <li>Recognized by courts</li>
        <li>Faster alternative to litigation</li>
